=== standard and override review ===
The cited standard is /Users/stevemorin/c/cli-standards/cli-design-standard.md,
version 1.4.14. R60 treats the R1.1/R6.1-style organisation rule as binding in
the same way R67 treats R6.1: it cites the canonical standard, calls the rule a
MUST, and relies on Decision Log row 1 as org-locked. OV-01 has the charter's
required `Argument` and `Options` fields, says explicitly that no owner waiver
record exists, and names conforming alternatives b and c. It does not claim an
owner waiver.

R60 nevertheless violates a separate applicable MUST: R1.3 requires singular
canonical resource nouns. The proposed mechanism and AC1/AC5/AC6 use `projects`
as the canonical documented command (`<tool> projects list`) and do not record
an alternative canonical `project` form with an undocumented plural alias. No
waiver is possible for this MUST.
